<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus, I must trust Thee,</l><l>Pondering Thy ways;</l><l>Full of love and mercy</l><l>All Thine earthly days:</l><l>Sinners gathered round Thee,</l><l>Lepers sought Thy face:</l><l>None too vile or loathsome</l><l>For a Savior’s grace.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus, I can trust Thee,</l><l>Trust Thy written Word,</l><l>Though Thy voice of pity</l><l>I have never heard:</l><l>When Thy Spirit teacheth,</l><l>To my taste how sweet!</l><l>Only may I hearken,</l><l>Sitting at Thy feet.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus, I do trust Thee,</l><l>Trust without a doubt;</l><l>Whosoever cometh</l><l>Thou wilt not cast out:</l><l>Faithful is Thy promise,</l><l>Precious is Thy blood:</l><l>These my soul’s salvation</l><l>Thou my Savior God!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
